---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---
<Layout title="页面未找到"><div class="shell not-found"><span class="eyebrow">A SMALL DETOUR / 404</span><div class="error-number">404<span>✳</span></div><h1>这颗星，暂时不在轨道上。</h1><p>链接可能已经变更，但下一次探索仍在等你。</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/">回到知识空间 <Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></a></div></Layout>
